 "capsule": "The Republic of Egypt was proclaimed on 18 June 1953, a year after the Free Officers' coup ended the Muhammad Ali monarchy, with Muhammad Naguib as its first president before Gamal Abdel Nasser consolidated power and formally assumed the presidency in 1956. Nasser nationalized the Suez Canal Company in July 1956, precipitating the Suez Crisis in which Israeli, British, and French forces invaded before withdrawing under US and Soviet pressure; on 1 February 1958 Egypt merged with Syria to form the United Arab Republic, ending the separate Republic of Egypt.",
